{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"সুনান আবু দাউদ","section":{"13":"Divorce (Kitab Al-Talaq)"},"section_detail":{"13":{"hadithnumber_first":2175,"hadithnumber_last":2312,"arabicnumber_first":2175,"arabicnumber_last":2312,"name_native":"তালাক অধ্যায়"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":2216,"arabicnumber":2216,"text":"। আবূ সালামাহ ইবনু ‘আব্দুর রহমান (রহ.) সূত্রে বর্ণিত। তিনি বলেন, ‘আরাক এমন থলে, যাতে পনের সা‘ পরিমাণ ধারণ হয়।[1] সহীহ।","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Daif"}],"reference":{"book":13,"hadith":42}}]}